uilamente.\r\n\r\n10/10\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1738122514, "timestamp_updated": 1738122514, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "186309295", "author": {"steamid": "76561199243809443", "personaname": "Fekxonet", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199243809443/", "num_games_owned": 46, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 5802, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5802, "last_played": 1719624983, "avatar": "738345e90541ec9e092fdad6321ae639eed49e4b"}, "language": "latam", "review": "BOM! Hola a todos,\r\n\r\nEsta es mi opion sobre el juego, es un game bastante bueno y divertido si tenes amigos se vulve mejor que jugarlo solo, la curba de aprendizaje no es dificil y cuando tienes la experticia en los niveles altos si es un reto facinante, graficos decentes y pulidos, musica interesante, pero aun mas los comentarios de los mineros.\r\n\r\n8.2/10", "timestamp_created": 1737739982, "timestamp_updated": 1737739982, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "186131142", "author": {"steamid": "76561198402438643", "personaname": "Noir1825", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198402438643/", "num_games_owned": 105, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 3228, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2249, "last_played": 1738815560, "avatar": "